OL,3,APutin says Russia, US, and China share
OL,4,A'joint responsibility' for global peace
OL,5,Aas talks begin
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump, Vladimir Putin, and Xi
OL,8,FJinping are holding talks in the
OL,9,FChinese city of Shenzhen
OL,11,FAs the meeting began, Xi said the talks
OL,12,Fhad "groundbreaking significance" -
OL,13,FTrump said they were "really making
OL,14,Fhistory"
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Putin said Russia, China,
OL,17,Fand the US share a "joint
OL,18,Fresponsibility" for "maintaining
OL,19,Finternational peace and security"
